{
  "description": "WBCQ P3 evaluation corpus (RFC #1093). Each entry is a step function `unsigned step(ctx *, unsigned in)`; `context_bytes` is sizeof(ctx). `expect` is what the RFC requires of the engine: `machine` (a quotient), or for a negative case any of `fail_closed` statuses.",
  "functions": [
